%!PS-Adobe-3.0 Resource-ColorRendering
%%Title: DefaultColorRendering
%%Creator: stet
%%EndComments

% The CRD findcolorrendering names when no other matches (ColorRendering ProcSet, GetSubstituteCRD).
% A type 1 CRD with a D65 white point; every other entry takes its identity default (PLRM 3rd ed., 7.1.4).

<<
    /ColorRenderingType 1
    /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089]
>>
